// Calendar events: dates ([month, day] ranges, may wrap over the new year) or weekdays (0 = Sun … 6 = Sat).
// While one is on, its guest stands on the plaza from `hours` with a little shop, and its decor
// (decor pieces, offsets from the guest) goes up around them. The first event that is on wins.
{
  entries: [
    {
      id: 'events:harvest', name: 'Ярмарка урожая', from: [11, 15], to: [11, 30], guest: 'events:bruno', hours: [8, 20],
